        "independent_answer": "Before free: p[0]={1,\"Park\"}, p[1]={2,\"Kim\"}; p+1 advances sizeof(struct Example) bytes. Headers: <stdlib.h> for malloc/free/exit, <stdio.h> for fprintf/stderr, <string.h> for strcpy. free(p), the original base address. Reading p->number after free is undefined behavior.",
